===== README.md =====
executable: false

# `apache-library`

[![npm version](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/apache-library.svg)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/apache-library)
[![License: Apache-2.0](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-Apache--2.0-blue.svg)](LICENSE)

A generated TypeScript library

## Install

```bash
pnpm add apache-library
```

## Usage

```ts
import { formatValue } from "apache-library";

const output = formatValue({ ready: true });
```

## Development

Lint, format, type-check, dependency and security policy checks, and tests are
wired into a single command:

```bash
pnpm run check         # lint + dep/security checks + typecheck + coverage
pnpm run test          # run tests
pnpm run build         # build to dist/
pnpm run release:check # package validation + publish dry run
```

`pnpm run security:lint` prefers `semgrep` on PATH and otherwise runs the pinned `uvx semgrep@1.172.0` scan.

See [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) for the conventions this project follows.

## License

[Apache-2.0](LICENSE) © Harold Martin.

